This project is provided as a portfolio demonstration of an end-to-end
RAG/AI application using APSIM-related content, Azure services, Docker,
and Azure Container Apps. The implementation is intended to show the
overall architecture and delivery workflow rather than represent a
production-ready APSIM interpretation system.

In particular, the `.apsimx` explanation and CSV summarisation features
use intentionally lightweight heuristics and prompt-driven summarisation.
Only a minimum attempt has been made to make those components deeply
complete or domain-exhaustive.

